Read `CLAUDE.md` for full architecture, patterns, and domain model maps.
Read `DB_SCHEMA_MAP.md` before writing any SQL query.

NEVER scan the full solution. Use CLAUDE.md maps to find exact files.
ALL SQL changes (DDL/procs) MUST be added to `Prg_UI/Scriptses/ScriptSqly.cs`.
Dapper parameterized queries only. No string concat for SQL.
All dates are Persian (Shamsi) 8-digit bigint or slash format.
Payroll dual-track: BASE_SAL (nominal) ≠ BASE_SAL_B (official). Never sum.
DB migrations: idempotent, transactional, @PREVIEW_ONLY support.
